== Usage ==

Place this infobox at the start of an attribute page. It covers the six
attributes raised directly by the player and the derived ratings granted by
gear. All fields are optional. The styling matches [[Template:Action]] and
[[Template:Status Effect]].

<pre>
{{Attribute
| abbreviation =
| group =
| equipment =
| materia =
}}
</pre>

* <code>abbreviation</code>: the short form used in menus and tooltips, such as STR, VIT, or DEX. Leave it blank if the game uses the full name.
* <code>group</code>: the attribute's section in the character sheet, matching the groups on [[:Category:Attributes|Attributes]].
* <code>equipment</code>: the number of gear pieces that grant the attribute, counted from the client's equipment table. This is a count, not an item list.
* <code>materia</code>: the number of materia that raise the attribute, counted from the client's materia table. Count each materia once, regardless of grade.
</noinclude>
